      "category": "technology",
      "title": "v1.4.0rc3",
      "summary": "Highlights Known Issues DSA models, including GLM-5.2, may produce incorrect output when using an NVFP4 KV cache. Kimi K3 DSpark with MegaMoE CuTe DSL TEP and CUDA graphs may hang during GB300 warmup. DeepSeek-V4-Pro initialization may run out of GPU memory when MPI workers are reused after large MoE workloads. Tensor-parallel serving with RPC orchestration may hang during model initialization when reusing an MPI worker pool across threads. Model Support Add Muse Spark Open model and configuration support #21042 , ",
      "url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA/TensorRT-LLM/releases/tag/v1.4.0rc3",
      "source": "TensorRT-LLM Releases",
